From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:30:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bonito/sargo: import the Soong namespaces lineage-24.0 added

Two upstream changes on lineage-24.0 put modules this tree uses behind
soong namespaces it does not import:

  hardware/qcom/wlan          "wlan: Guard with soong namespace"
  hardware/google/pixel/{health,pixelstats,power-libperfmgr,usb}
                              "pixel: Guard anything that depends on
                               pixelatoms with a soong namespace"

Without the first, libwifi-hal's `defaults: ["libwifi-hal-qcom"]` no
longer finds the dispatch cc_defaults at the top of hardware/qcom/wlan
and instead resolves to the cc_library of the same name in
hardware/qcom/wlan/legacy ("module libwifi-hal-qcom is not an defaults
module"). Without the second, libpixelhealth, libpixelstats,
pixelatoms-cpp, libpixelusb and the libperfmgr power service are
invisible both to PRODUCT_PACKAGES and to this tree's own namespace.

hardware/qcom/wlan is listed before hardware/qcom/wlan/legacy: the root
namespace searches PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES in order, and the defaults
module must win over the library.
---
 Android.bp | 3 +++
 device.mk  | 5 +++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 3d0dcf0c..af06c92b 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@ soong_namespace {
     imports: [
         "hardware/google/interfaces",
         "hardware/google/pixel",
+        "hardware/google/pixel/health",
+        "hardware/google/pixel/pixelstats",
+        "hardware/google/pixel/usb",
     ],
 }
 
diff --git a/device.mk b/device.mk
index b7a4cb44..c29e665a 100644
--- a/device.mk
+++ b/device.mk
@@ -22,9 +22,14 @@ PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES += \
     hardware/google/camera \
     hardware/google/interfaces \
     hardware/google/pixel \
+    hardware/google/pixel/health \
+    hardware/google/pixel/pixelstats \
+    hardware/google/pixel/power-libperfmgr \
+    hardware/google/pixel/usb \
     hardware/qcom/audio \
     hardware/qcom/sdm845/display \
     hardware/qcom/sdm845/gps \
+    hardware/qcom/wlan \
     hardware/qcom/wlan/legacy \
     hardware/qcom-caf/bootctrl \
     vendor/qcom/opensource/data-ipa-cfg-mgr-legacy-um
